The legislative texts in this repository are from gzk.rks-gov.net, the Official Gazette of the Republic of Kosovo
(Gazeta Zyrtare e Republikës së Kosovës). Under Law No. 08/L-205 on Copyright and Related Rights, article 6(1),
copyright protection does not extend to official texts of a legislative, administrative and judicial nature, nor to
the official translations of such texts ("Mbrojtja e të drejtës së autorit nuk përfshinë tekstet zyrtare të natyrës
legjislative, administrative dhe gjyqësore dhe përkthimet zyrtare të teksteve të tilla."). The texts are reproduced
without change to their wording, split into one file per article.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
